Issue #24668: [Architecture] Proactive Agent Feed System & Action Cards Engine

This PR implements the requested backend infrastructure and API endpoint for the proactive agent feed system:
- Defines strict multi-tenant schema `agent_actions` table.
- Orchestrates `AgentFeedService` taking gRPC endpoints.
- Avoids duplicated actions using Redis Redlock (`SET NX EX`).
- Builds a `GET /api/v1/agent-feed` and `GET /api/v1/agent-feed/activity` endpoint that maps the backend models appropriately to the Next.js UI component's structure.
- Migrates the existing dashboard UI in `UnifiedAgentFeed.tsx` to rely on the new `api/v1/agent-feed` rather than the old approvals interface.
- 100% unit tests added for `agent_feed` service.
- End-to-end testing fully covers the unified agent feed interactions.
- Loaded Superpowers UI workflow for strict validation.

Resolves #24668
